  "summary": {
    "text": "Aya 23 is a family of multilingual open-weights language models from Cohere For AI, released on 23 May 2024 in 8-billion and 35-billion-parameter sizes under CC-BY-NC. The text-only models cover 23 languages with an 8,192-token context and pair a pre-trained Command-family model with the Aya data collection; Cohere says they aim at depth rather than breadth.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "src.cohere.aya-23-announcement"
      },
      {
        "id": "src.cohere.hf-aya-23-8b"
      },
