  "notes": "Developed by Cohere For AI (now Cohere Labs) with Cohere. Two sizes released together, recorded as inline variants. The model cards say Aya 23 pairs a pre-trained model of the Command family with the Aya Collection, without naming which Command model, so no derived-from relation is recorded. The model cards now call Aya 23 an older version and point to Aya Expanse. Hugging Face repositories created 2024-05-19, probably private before launch."
